edition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[29,18,68,64,81,42],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013602"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[29,18,68,64,81,42],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013602"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[29,18,68,64,81,42],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013602"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[29,18,68,64,81,42],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"120","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013602"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[29,18,68,64,81,42],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013602"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[29,18,68,64,81,42],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013602"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴大帝孙权与步皇后之幼女，吴景帝孙休的姐姐兼岳母，孙鲁班之妹。因其初嫁左将军朱据，故又称“朱公主”；后改嫁车骑将军刘纂，史称“刘公主”。在“二宫之争”中，敏锐意识到废太子孙和将引发内乱，拒绝支持胞姐孙鲁班的阴谋，主张“立嫡以长”，从此两人有了嫌隙。五凤二年，孙仪等密谋趁蜀汉使者到来之际杀死权臣孙峻，因事情泄露而自杀，牵连被杀的达到几十人。全公主孙鲁班记恨妹妹当年不肯帮自己，就污蔑孙鲁育是孙仪的同谋，导致孙鲁育也被孙峻杀害。","tc":"吳大帝孫權與步皇后之幼女，吳景帝孫休的姐姐兼岳母，孫魯班之妹。因其初嫁左將軍朱據，故又稱“朱公主”；后改嫁車騎將軍劉纂，史稱“劉公主”。在“二宮之爭”中，敏銳意識到廢太子孫和將引發內亂，拒絕支持胞姐孫魯班的陰謀，主張“立嫡以長”，從此兩人有了嫌隙。五鳳二年，孫儀等密謀趁蜀漢使者到來之際殺死權臣孫峻，因事情泄露而自殺，牽連被殺的達到幾十人。全公主孫魯班記恨妹妹當年不肯幫自己，就污蔑孫魯育是孫儀的同謀，導致孫魯育也被孫峻殺害。","en":"The youngest daughter of Sun Quan, Emperor Da of Wu, and Empress Bu, elder sister and mother-in-law of Emperor Jing of Wu (Sun Xiu), and younger sister of Sun Luban. Because she first married East Commander Zhu Ju, she was called ‘Princess Zhu’, after remarrying Marshal Liu Zuan, she was known to history as ‘Princess Liu’. During the ‘Two Palaces dispute’, she keenly realized that deposing Crown Prince Sun He would provoke civil strife and refused to support the schemes of her elder sister Sun Luban, advocating ‘succession by the eldest’, which created a rift between the sisters. In the 2nd year of Wufeng (255), Sun Yi and others conspired to assassinate the regent Sun Jun during the arrival of a Shu Han envoy, when the plot was exposed, Sun Yi took his own life, and dozens were implicated and killed. Princess Quan, Sun Luban, harboring a grudge over her sister's past refusal to help her, falsely accused Sun Luyu of being Sun Yi's accomplice, leading to Sun Luyu also being killed by Sun Jun.","jp":"呉の大帝・孫権と歩皇后の末娘。呉の景帝・孫休の姉であり岳母でもある。孫魯班の妹。はじめ左将軍の朱拠に嫁いだため「朱公主」とも呼ばれ、後に車騎将軍の劉纂に再嫁したため、史書には「劉公主」と記されている。「二宮の変」においては、皇太子・孫和の廃立が内乱を招くことを鋭く察知し、同母姉である孫魯班の陰謀への協力を拒絶して「嫡子を立てるには年長者によるべし」と主張したことから、姉妹の間に亀裂が生じた。五鳳二年、孫儀らが蜀漢の使者の来訪に乗じて権臣・孫峻の暗殺を謀るも、計画が露見して自害し、連座して処刑された者は数十人に及んだ。全公主・孫魯班はかつて妹が力を貸さなかったことを恨み、孫魯育が孫儀の共謀者であると誣告したため、孫魯育も孫峻によって殺害された。","kr":"오 대제 손권과 보황후의 막내딸이자 오 경제 손휴의 누나 겸 장모로, 손노반의 여동생입니다. 처음에는 좌장군 주거에게 출가하여 '주공주'라고도 불렸으며, 훗날 거기장군 유찬에게 재가하여 사서에는 '유공주'로 기록되었습니다.'이궁의 변' 당시 태자 손화를 폐위하면 내란이 일어날 것임을 예리하게 간파하고, 친언니 손노반의 음모에 동조하기를 거부하며 '입적이장(적통이자 장자를 세움)'을 주장하여 이때부터 두 사람 사이에 틈이 생겼습니다. 오봉 2년, 손의 등이 촉한의 사신이 당도하는 틈을 타 권신 손준을 주살하려 모의했으나 일이 누설되자 자결하였고, 이에 연루되어 목숨을 잃은 자가 수십 명에 달했습니다. 전공주 손노반은 예전에 동생이 자신을 돕지 않았던 일에 앙심을 품고 손노육이 손의의 공모자라고 모함하였으며, 결국 손노육마저 손준에게 살해당했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10219","remark":"","surname":"孙","surnameTc":"孫","surnameEn":"Sun","surnameJp":"孫","surnameKr":"손","surnameOther":"","name":"鲁育","nameTc":"魯育","nameEn":"Luyu","nameJp":"魯育","nameKr":"노육","nameOther":"","word":"小虎","wordTc":"小虎","wordEn":"Xiaohu","wordJp":"小虎","wordKr":"소호","wordOther":"","icon":"孙鲁育","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"218","city":"CS1053","gender":"1","rule":"29","force":"18","wise":"68","politics":"64","charm":"81","will":"42","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"11","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"2/2/2/2/2/24/78/2","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000705","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"300","debateSoulPoint":"4600","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001305","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/1/0/1/0/1/0/0/0/2/0/1/1/0/0/4/3/0/0/0","attribute2":"32/18/73/74/81/45","morality":"5","compatible":"83","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"3000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"205","show":"218","death":"255","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"2","weapon":"WP1008702","armor":"WP1014602","helmet":"WP1013602","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;19/2;20/1;29/1;37/1;63/1;21/1;23/1;12/1;31/0","father":"WJ10020